{"pageid":4181,"title":"Corrupted","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Corrupted</span>","revid":19722,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/51/Acacia_log_vs%2C_Corrupted_Acacia_log.png/revision/latest?cb=20250930191406\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Corrupted Acacia log and Acacia log side by side\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/51/Acacia_log_vs%2C_Corrupted_Acacia_log.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250930191406\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"164\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Acacia log vs, Corrupted Acacia log.png\" data-image-key=\"Acacia_log_vs%2C_Corrupted_Acacia_log.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Acacia_log_vs,_Corrupted_Acacia_log.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Corrupted Acacia log and Acacia log side by side</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Corrupted is a general tree type that appears after a tree being hit by <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushroom</a>'s projectile. Cactus, Acacia and Deadwood have corrupted variants while any other wood types will become regular Corrupted. Players often seen them hitting Mushrooms and thought Corrupted must only be spawned by Mushrooms.\n</p><p>Corrupted has a dark purple brown-ish color outside and dark messy purple color inside. All trees being made Corrupted has same properties. Big tree or small all takes 1 hit from the projectile to be converted into Corrupted. Corrupted state convert the tree's bark color and inside as well as not changing any sizing, meshes (like Mushroom cap) begone, union (like most trees complex leaves) become a solid 1 block purple leaf based on model's shape. \n</p><p>Corrupted sells for 1$ per stud, and corrupted variants sell for half the value of their normal counterparts.\n</p><p>Anyone who can edit, please add other facts here\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902200808\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4181-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902200808 and revision id 19722. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Trees"],"links":[{"title":"Mysterious Mushrooms","exists":true}],"images":["Acacia_log_vs,_Corrupted_Acacia_log.png"]}
